The air bubbles seem a bit random.  After a while, you should be able
to tell when the bubbles temporarily merge with each other.  Tactic #1
is to stay in the 1st bubble until it temporarily merges with the
portal bubble.  Tactic #2 is to switch bubbles at every chance you get.
 I am still not sure if one of the tactics is better than the other.

Sometimes an air bubble drops a corpse onto the portal.  If you can't
find the portal, then stand on the corpses to see if the portal is
there.

If you don't have a way to prevent drowning, then you should stay in
the air bubbles.  Otherwise, feel free to levitate across the water to
speed up the portal finding.


